factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 5 problems
  Reel script and slides say the protest was held at 'Goundampalayam' panchayat office, but the article says the protest was in 87-Goundampalayam panchayat office within Elachipalayam union; the reel also drops the '87' panchayat identifier in the headline/reel, merging two location names.
  Caption says the sewage stagnation has persisted for 'பல மாதங்களாக' and the protest is 'இதனால்' (because of this) the 300 families are affected — the caption uses 'இதனால் நேற்று' implying the families' suffering caused the protest, which the article does not state as a direct causal link.
  Slide 'நடவடிக்கை இல்லை' claims a demand that the sewage be removed, which is only implied in the article's headline rather than stated as a specific demand in the body.
  Caption claims the protest was 'படுத்து உறங்கும் போராட்டம்' held at the panchayat office in the same sentence that describes the sewage problem as affecting '300க்கும் மேற்பட்ட குடும்பங்கள் துர்நாற்றத்தால் அவதிப்படுகின்றனர்', mixing two facts into one sentence in an unclear way.
  Caption date line '🗓️ நாள்: நவம்பர் 12, நேற்று' gives a specific date not present in the article; the article only says 'நேற்று' (yesterday) without any calendar date.
